      that several developers reproduced the attack with frontier-model
      assistance and advised treating the vulnerability as actively exploitable.
      That is reproduction after disclosure, not the unknown original discovery
      method: <a href="/response/ai/">the AI page</a> carries the quotation and
      works the distinction through.
